		(descr "Hirose FH34SRJ-24S-0.5SH(50), 24 pos, 0.5 mm pitch, 1.0 mm high, top+bottom contact, back-flip actuator, 0.3 mm FPC (LCSC C324726). Recommended PCB mounting pattern from the Hirose FH34SRJ datasheet: signal pads 0.3x0.8, B=11.5, fitting nails 0.4x0.8 with E=13.1 / F=13.9, 3.3 from signal-pad outer edge to nail outer edge. Pad 1 at +X (right, as in the Hirose top view). The FPC inserts from +Y (the side away from the signal pads); the signal pads are under the actuator side. Body outline on Fab is approximate (A=14.0, D=13.38, depth 3.8).")
